>>>>
>>>> I thought I just did. 
>>>>
>>>
>>>
>>> Where is {dei}  in {lo za'u cusku}. Does "we" include only those who 
>>> speak or those to whom something is spoken? No.
>>>
>>> "we" is either {mi no'u za'umei} or {mi jo'u da poi prenu gi'e na'e 
>>> cusku be dei gi'e na'e te cusku be dei}
>>>
>>>
